We can easily last for another hour, it feels like, and maybe more.

486
00:56:57,323 --> 00:56:59,693
Then I turn to you, Göran.

487
00:57:01,337 --> 00:57:07,337
Would you be able to in a few minutes max sum up the most important things you heard today

488
00:57:08,137 --> 00:57:10,087
And how you look on the road forward?

489
00:57:12,038 --> 00:57:17,018
I thought there were many very important views that came out.

490
00:57:17,018 --> 00:57:24,028
I think it is easy for us to underestimate how important Wasp is.

491
00:59:16,470 --> 00:59:19,550
What would the military say clear sign from Colonel.

492
00:59:19,550 --> 00:59:23,880
We have a clear sign from research, from use within Sweden

493
00:59:23,880 --> 00:59:27,500
Especially outside Sweden, lots of experiences to take off.

494
00:59:27,954 --> 00:59:34,284
It ends up very much on Swedish leaders, to act now.

495
00:59:34,961 --> 00:59:39,681
On my part, this is no criticism of poor leaders who have a lot to do.

496
00:59:40,265 --> 00:59:45,525
But one needs to prioritize this issue quite strongly, I think

497
00:59:45,608 --> 00:59:47,428
From a leadership perspective.

498
00:59:47,807 --> 00:59:48,707
Good.
Thanks, Göran.

499
00:59:48,913 --> 00:59:52,393
We're pulling over a minute.
It goes well, I hope.

500
00:59:53,477 --> 00:59:58,105
Big thanks for all your input in this very important discussion.

501
00:59:58,546 --> 01:00:03,666
We can note that much of Sweden wants to see a completely different level of ambition

502
01:00:04,027 --> 01:00:06,647
Around how we invest and take care of AI.

503
01:00:07,223 --> 01:00:13,823
Vinnova is fully included in that ambition and look forward to that in every way we can

504
01:00:13,823 --> 01:00:16,563
assist in this power collection to invest ahead.

505
01:00:16,563 --> 01:00:19,223
We believe it is incredibly important.

506
01:00:20,251 --> 01:00:22,251
It may be my short summation.

507
01:00:23,138 --> 01:00:27,228
We look forward to a Sweden that decided to invest even more in AI.

508
01:00:27,915 --> 01:00:32,145
Big thanks to the panel and to you who listened

509
01:00:32,145 --> 01:00:35,215
And all the questions that have come in that we have not been able to answer.
